  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "Brandon Pugh said that not looking at how AI is helping on cyber defense puts one at a huge disadvantage. He also said that leveraging AI is a national security imperative. In June 2024 testimony, he said AI requires guardrails to maintain consumer privacy and adequately secure data, and that findings show many current uses of AI for cyber defense. He also noted that there are risks, especially within the energy space.",
   "sids": [
    "s1",
    "s2",
    "s3",
    "s4",
    "s5"
   ],
   "sentences": [
    {
     "text": "Brandon Pugh said that not looking at how AI is helping on cyber defense puts one at a huge disadvantage.",
